  <!--
        Wayfaring is merged for one power's description only. Per docs/STYLEGUIDE.md 1.0c the
        loader merges at the level of the individual power keyed by Name, keeping every attribute
        not restated - so Class, Cost, Attribute, Minimum, Snippet and Tile all stay vanilla's and
        only the text changes. Restating Class here would replace Survival_Trailblazer and take
        the vanilla behaviour with it.

        The three sentences above the new one are vanilla's own, restated because Description is
        one attribute and cannot be appended to. They must stay in step if Freehold edits them;
        check_vanilla_drift is what would notice.

        The added sentence names the option because it cannot be gated on it. XML loads once, long
        before any option is read, so this text is present either way and has to stay true either
        way. See issue #470.
    -->
  <skill Name="Wayfaring" Load="Merge">
    <power
      Name="Mind's Compass"
      Description="Doubles the chance of regaining your bearings when you are lost.
Reduces chance of getting lost by about 15%.
You travel on the world map twice as quickly.
While the Qud Expanded bearings option is on, you know which of a parasang's nine zones you are standing in."
    />
  </skill>
</skills>
